      "message": "Just a comment on the behavior: I think people are pretty used to holding the power button until the AP power cycles, as distinct from counting a number of seconds and then releasing without having seen a response. To support this usage with dock power buttons, we would have to treat a press as a long press based on a timer, before receiving the corresponding release.\n\nThe main downside to this would be that a dock glitch could power cycle the AP, so I can see why we might not want to do it.",
